@pat.kids.animals.x3.neg.t core.pattern
    match="[$kids.animals.g2_remember]? [a|an|the|every|any|all|each|some]? {a:noun} [cannot|can_not|cant|cant_ever|can_t|do_not|dont|does_not|doesnt|never|is_not_able_to|are_not_able_to|isnt_able_to|arent_able_to|is_unable_to|are_unable_to|unable_to|cannot_ever|will_never|can_never|cant_even|dont_ever|are_incapable_of|is_incapable_of|has_no_way_to|have_no_way_to|doesnt_know_how_to|dont_know_how_to] {ab:lex.kids.animals.abilities} [$kids.animals.g38_btw]?"
